 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 공학교육혁신센터 0명 : 문의 054-478-7953</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 도서관 00명 : 문의 054-478-7178</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 부서 신청방법</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 희망부서 문의 [직접방문 또는 전화] → 희망부서 온라인 신청 [근무부서와 협의 완료 후 신청]</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 근로장학생 선발 확정&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 온라인 신청방법 : 원스톱서비스 로그인 - 학생지원 - 근로장학생 신청서 제출</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청 상세내역작성(계좌등록, 근무부서, 희망 부서 및 희망근무시간 입력) </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청버튼 클릭 - 완료</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 선발일정</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 학생 : 희망근무부서 신청[2.19.(월)~2.21.(수)10:00 ~ 8.10.(목)18:00 까지]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 각 해당부서 : 각 부서에서 희망근무부서 신청자 명단 확인하여 해당 학생에게 연락 확인 후 추천</span><br><span style=